<Chapter id="changelog">
<h2>Document changelog</h2>
  <p>The newest revision is first. Each date records client validation of the
  documented result. All entries apply to SC2
  <code>5.0.16.97563</code>. The BSN metadata comes from build <code>97364</code>.</p>

  <dl>
    <dt>2026-08-16 — generated layouts and route audit</dt>
    <dd><ul>
      <li>Documented <code>0x40</code> generated-handling eligibility and the
      separate wire-layout data.</li>
      <li>Documented the declarative field-permutation and filler-run model, verified
      reflected layouts, candidate layouts, and remaining custom codecs.</li>
      <li>Added the identity chain across Front accounts, SC2 game accounts, toons,
      profile addresses, presence aliases, and channel-local member handles.</li>
      <li>Added <code>Achv/0</code> and <code>Achv/2</code>, plus newly captured Auth,
      Conn, Chat, Party, S2Master, S2Map, Profile, and Toon routes.</li>
      <li>Documented the <code>BNET/ERRS/enUS</code> cache catalog and depot content
      handle format.</li>
      <li>Clarified join-response token correlation and the optional public channel
      name ID in successful <code>Chat/27</code> responses.</li>
    </ul></dd>

    <dt>2026-08-15 — implementation audit</dt>
    <dd><ul>
      <li>Separated schema-delimited service records from fixed 16-bit command responses.</li>
      <li>Replaced the runtime-registry model with the static slot map used by the code.</li>
      <li>Split route coverage by direction and added the implemented Party routes.</li>
      <li>Added Chat invitation, party-status, and datagram routes.</li>
      <li>Marked <code>Chat/32</code> and <code>Chat/33</code> unsupported pending a
      later official-client capture; the following revision restores them with
      generated layouts.</li>
      <li>Aligned Front message framing, SDK identity, callback handling, and chat bootstrap notes.</li>
      <li>Added readable native payload definitions.</li>
    </ul></dd>

    <dt>2026-08-09 — Social graph</dt>
    <dd><ul>
      <li>Added <code>Chat/19</code> send and receive.</li>
      <li>Added <code>Chat/30</code> echo.</li>
      <li>Documented the <code>Chat/20</code> route with payload decoding pending.</li>
      <li>Added the <code>PlayerTarget</code> choice.</li>
      <li>Added <code>S2Mp/46</code>, <code>51</code>, <code>53</code>,
      <code>54</code>, and <code>55</code>.</li>
      <li>Added <code>Pres/2</code>, <code>3</code>, and <code>4</code>.</li>
      <li>Added more <code>Pres/0</code> field handles.</li>
      <li>Added <code>Prfl/1</code>, <code>Prfl/3</code>, and
      <code>Frnd/6</code>.</li>
      <li>Set the client channel limit to six concurrent channels.</li>
      <li>Added the 16 reserved bits in the <code>Chat/0</code> club locator.</li>
    </ul></dd>

    <dt>2026-08-04 — Initial reference</dt>
    <dd><ul>
      <li>Added the Front RPC connection and logon sequence.</li>
      <li>Added the Front-to-Sunken handoff.</li>
      <li>Added the Sunken record format and BSN metadata.</li>
      <li>Added Resume authentication and transport protection.</li>
      <li>Added the native service-slot map.</li>
      <li>Added the core native services.</li>
    </ul></dd>
  </dl>
  <BackToContents />
</Chapter>
